012:p0384:b003:l040","ordinal":323813,"en":"Flesh to stone,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b002:l001","ordinal":323814,"en":"Külchoro will take your life,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b002:l002","ordinal":323815,"en":"Hero Seytek will spill your blood,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b002:l003","ordinal":323816,"en":"Kanchoro, you beast-like fool,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b002:l004","ordinal":323817,"en":"You have courage but no sense,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b002:l005","ordinal":323818,"en":"You care about nothing,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b002:l006","ordinal":323819,"en":"In all the world no fool was born"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b002:l007","ordinal":323820,"en":"To equal you."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b002:l008","ordinal":323821,"en":"A stone will strike your temple,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b002:l009","ordinal":323822,"en":"A spear will pierce your side,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b002:l010","ordinal":323823,"en":"A lasso will catch your steed;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b002:l011","ordinal":323824,"en":"Standing thus, he will shoot—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b002:l012","ordinal":323825,"en":"This kinsman of yours, Külchoro,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b002:l013","ordinal":323826,"en":"Not your kinsman, but your foe,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b002:l014","ordinal":323827,"en":"And the regret will be your own."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b002:l015","ordinal":323828,"en":"You act upon a fool’s words;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b002:l016","ordinal":323829,"en":"When trouble rises behind you,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b002:l017","ordinal":323830,"en":"You will say, “Ah, had I not obeyed a woman!”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b002:l018","ordinal":323831,"en":"Braggart warrior Kanchoro,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b002:l019","ordinal":323832,"en":"You will bite your finger in regret!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b002:l020","ordinal":323833,"en":"You will bring torment on yourself,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b002:l021","ordinal":323834,"en":"Your wake will be turmoil and uproar,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b002:l022","ordinal":323835,"en":"Aichürök will suffer much plunder"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b002:l023","ordinal":323836,"en":"And face calamity many times."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b002:l024","ordinal":323837,"en":"You will be left shaking your head;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b002:l025","ordinal":323838,"en":"A mighty upheaval, a great conflict,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b002:l026","ordinal":323839,"en":"You yourself will choose."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b002:l027","ordinal":323840,"en":"If you regard this slave as your own,"}]
